{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 20/01/2025, the use of the ground floor rear flat referred to as Flat 4, Pownall Gardens, TW3 1YW as a self-contained dwelling was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe applicant has provided sufficient information to evidence that, on the balance of probabilities, the property has been in use as a self-contained unit for the continuous period of four years.\r\n\r\n"
